# Port-Based Persistence

Source of truth: `docs/architecture/persistence.md`.

## Placement

| Artifact | Location |
|----------|----------|
| Repository ports | `packages/domain/<context>/ports` |
| Domain errors | `packages/domain/<context>/errors` |
| Domain models | `packages/domain/<context>` |
| TypeORM entities + mappers + repo impls | `packages/infrastructure-postgres/<context>` |
| Migrations (global) | `packages/infrastructure-postgres/migrations` |
| `UnitOfWork` port | `packages/platform` |
| `UnitOfWork` impl | `packages/infrastructure-postgres` |
| In-memory fakes | `packages/application/src/testing` |

## Separate Models + Mappers

```typescript
// domain — pure
export interface TenantRepository {
  findById(id: TenantId): Promise<Tenant | null>
  save(tenant: Tenant): Promise<void>
}

// infrastructure-postgres — TypeORM entity (never exported as domain)
@Entity('tenants')
export class TenantEntity {
  @PrimaryColumn('uuid') id!: string
  @Column() name!: string
  @Column() status!: string
}

// mapper
export const TenantMapper = {
  toDomain(e: TenantEntity): Tenant { /* … */ },
  toEntity(t: Tenant): TenantEntity { /* … */ },
}
```

## Unit of Work

```typescript
// platform
export interface UnitOfWork {
  run<T>(work: () => Promise<T>): Promise<T>
}

// application
await this.uow.run(async () => {
  await this.tenants.save(tenant)
  await this.memberships.save(ownerMembership)
})
```

Do **not** put `EntityManager` on domain port signatures.

## Tenant-Aware Repositories

Tenant-owned repos extend `TenantAwareRepository` (ambient `TenantContext`). See `multi-tenancy.mdc`.

## Cross-Context Data

- FKs only **within** a context
- Across contexts: store branded IDs (`userId`, `tenantId`, `roleId`) — no cross-context FKs/joins

## Anti-Patterns

```typescript
// ❌ Port leaking TypeORM
export interface TenantRepository {
  getRepo(): Repository<TenantEntity>
}

// ❌ Domain model = TypeORM entity
@Entity('tenants')
export class Tenant { /* domain methods */ }

// ❌ Application importing EntityManager / contracts DTOs
```
